 "notes": "CardDemo's add-user screen (transaction CU01, program COUSR01C): entered from the admin menu it sends the empty screen; re-entered with the five fields it validates them in order and WRITEs the user security record (DUPREC: 'User ID already exist...'); PF3 returns to the admin menu, PF4 clears. Its first proof of a CICS file update: each scenario's USRSEC file is compared after the task. usrsec.txt is the ten users of CardDemo's own app/jcl/DUSRSECJ.jcl in-stream data (SYSUT1 DD *). Derived from CardDemo (Apache-2.0; Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates): LICENSE and NOTICE here are the source's own.",
